source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: Jira skips every space and tab between the `.` and the content, so the heading text carries none of them.
-- input.jira --
* h1.	y
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li><h1><a name="y"></a>y</h1></li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- # y
-- warnings.json --
[]
